{
  "id": "dmw7v6jwu114g",
  "name": "紧凑态展开",
  "tags": [
    "展开",
    "动画"
  ],
  "summary": "小卡片里的每个元素都保留并放大成弹窗：封面变大、播放键下移、空位里长出新控件。",
  "usage": "卡片与弹窗的元素能一一对应、可整体放大的场景（媒体播放器、详情卡、快捷操作面板）；卡片元素越多，过渡越自然。",
  "caution": "元素对不上时别用（会退化成「另一个窗口」，改用「卡片放大弹窗」）；弹窗新增内容超过一半、或卡片本身信息太少时，过渡会显得突兀。",
  "hint": "点播放器卡片展开：封面放大、控件长出来",
  "prompt": "【紧凑态展开】目标：**同一张卡片原地长大**成为完整播放器——卡片容器变大、封面从左上小图长成顶部大图、标题和控件随布局下移，空出来的位置依次长出时间轴、音量、底部动作行。\n\n1) **只有一个 DOM**：紧凑态和展开态是同一个 `.player` 的两种尺寸（`.expanded`），不是两套 DOM 做 FLIP。\n\n2) **布局用绝对定位**：封面、标题、控制行、动作按钮、新增控件全部 `position:absolute`，两种状态各给一套 left/top/width/height 并加 transition。\n\n3) 容器 `translate(-50%,-50%)` 居中 + width/height 过渡（0.38s），中心点不动。\n\n4) **纵向节奏要排满**：标题 152 / 进度 174 / 播放键 198（高 40）/ 音量 250 / 动作行 284（高 34），卡片总高 330 → 底部只剩 16px。之前音量条 252、动作行 262 是**重叠**的（只差 10px），而底下又空出 44px，看起来一边挤一边空。\n\n5) **动作按钮的视觉规格**：不要圆形底板、不要边框，图标本身就是按钮。默认 `color:var(--ui-text-dim)`，hover `var(--ui-text)`；点击 `:active{transform:scale(.82)}` + `cubic-bezier(.34,1.6,.64,1)` 回弹（其实就是「先变小再变大」）。\n\n6) **底部三个按钮等距对称**：`252 = 35 + 34 + 40 + 34 + 40 + 34 + 35` → `35 / 109 / 183`。\n\n7) **喜欢是同一个元素**：紧凑态右上角（112,12）→ 展开左下（35,284），放大 26→34。点击切换 `.liked`（空心→实心+品牌色+`aria-pressed`），`stopPropagation`。\n\n8) **收起只认「点卡片外面」**：`player.click` 只在未展开时展开；`document.click` 判断 `!player.contains(e.target)` 才收起。展开态点卡片本身不切换——否则点喜欢、点进度都会被误判成收起。\n\n9) 新增控件（时间轴/音量/评论/分享）：`opacity:0; translateY(6px); pointer-events:none` → 展开态淡入，delay 0.12s。\n\n10) 不加全屏遮罩；卡片模式（≤420 高）展开 218×168、隐藏音量条。\n\n11) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（点卡片 → 长大 → 点喜欢 → 点卡片外收起）。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px}\n\n.stage{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;min-height:150px}\n\n/* 就一张卡片：紧凑态和展开态是同一个元素的不同尺寸，中心不动 */\n.player{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);\n  width:150px;height:166px;border-radius:16px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  cursor:pointer;overflow:hidden;user-select:none;\n  box-shadow:0 10px 28px color-mix(in srgb,#000 16%,transparent);\n  transition:width .38s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),height .38s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),\n             box-shadow .3s ease,border-radius .38s ease}\n.player.expanded{width:252px;height:330px;border-radius:22px;\n  box-shadow:0 26px 60px color-mix(in srgb,#000 26%,transparent)}\n\n.cover{position:absolute;left:12px;top:12px;width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 70%,transparent),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 22%,transparent));\n  transition:left .38s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),top .38s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),\n             width .38s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),height .38s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),border-radius .38s ease}\n.player.expanded .cover{left:14px;top:14px;width:224px;height:128px;border-radius:14px}\n\n/* 动作按钮：无底板无边框，靠颜色深浅和缩放表达状态 */\n.like,.act{position:absolute;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0;margin:0;\n  background:transparent;border:0;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ui-text-dim);\n  transition:left .38s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),top .38s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),\n             color .15s ease,transform .22s cubic-bezier(.34,1.6,.64,1)}\n.like:hover,.act:hover{color:var(--ui-text)}\n.like:active,.act:active{transform:scale(.82)}\n.like svg,.act svg{display:block}\n\n.like{left:112px;top:12px;width:26px;height:26px}\n.like svg{width:13px;height:13px}\n.like.liked{color:var(--ui-brand)}\n.like.liked svg path{fill:currentColor}\n.player.expanded .like{left:35px;top:284px;width:34px;height:34px}\n.player.expanded .like svg{width:16px;height:16px}\n\n.title{position:absolute;left:12px;top:80px;right:12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:var(--ui-text);\n  white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;\n  transition:top .38s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),font-size .3s ease}\n.player.expanded .title{top:152px;font-size:14px}\n.title b{float:right;font-weight:400;font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);letter-spacing:1px}\n\n.ctrl{position:absolute;left:12px;right:12px;top:106px;height:34px;\n  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:24px;\n  transition:top .38s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1),height .38s ease}\n.player.expanded .ctrl{top:198px;height:40px;gap:34px}\n.ctrl i{display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.ctrl .play{color:var(--ui-text)}\n.ctrl svg{transition:width .3s ease,height .3s ease}\n.player.expanded .ctrl svg{width:26px;height:26px}\n.player.expanded .ctrl svg.side{width:18px;height:18px}\n\n.extra{position:absolute;opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px);pointer-events:none;\n  transition:opacity .24s ease .12s,transform .3s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1) .12s}\n.player.expanded .extra{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}\n\n/* 纵向节奏：标题 152 / 进度 174 / 播放 198 / 音量 250 / 动作 284，间距基本一致 */\n.timeline{left:12px;right:12px;top:174px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:9px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.timeline .bar{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--ui-border);overflow:hidden}\n.timeline .bar i{display:block;width:18%;height:100%;background:var(--ui-brand);border-radius:2px}\n\n.volume{left:12px;right:12px;top:250px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:10px;color:var(--ui-text-dim)}\n.volume .vbar{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--ui-border);overflow:hidden}\n.volume .vbar i{display:block;width:46%;height:100%;background:var(--ui-text);border-radius:2px}\n\n/* 底部动作行：252 = 35 + 34 + 40 + 34 + 40 + 34 + 35 */\n.act{width:34px;height:34px}\n.act svg{width:16px;height:16px}\n.act.comment{left:109px;top:284px}\n.act.share{left:183px;top:284px}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:10px}\n  .player{width:130px;height:140px;border-radius:14px}\n  .player.expanded{width:218px;height:168px;border-radius:18px}\n  .cover{left:10px;top:10px;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:8px}\n  .player.expanded .cover{left:10px;top:10px;width:198px;height:48px;border-radius:12px}\n  .like{left:98px;top:10px;width:22px;height:22px}\n  .like svg{width:11px;height:11px}\n  .player.expanded .like{left:38px;top:134px;width:26px;height:26px}\n  .player.expanded .like svg{width:13px;height:13px}\n  .title{left:10px;top:64px;right:10px;font-size:10px}\n  .player.expanded .title{top:64px;font-size:11px}\n  .ctrl{left:10px;right:10px;top:84px;height:30px;gap:20px}\n  .player.expanded .ctrl{top:92px;height:30px;gap:26px}\n  .timeline{left:10px;right:10px;top:78px}\n  .volume{display:none}\n  /* 218 = 38 + 26 + 32 + 26 + 32 + 26 + 38 */\n  .act{width:26px;height:26px}\n  .act svg{width:13px;height:13px}\n  .act.comment{left:96px;top:134px}\n  .act.share{left:154px;top:134px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .player,.cover,.like,.act,.title,.ctrl,.ctrl svg,.extra{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"stage\">\n  <div class=\"player\" id=\"player\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"播放器，点击展开\">\n    <div class=\"cover\"></div>\n    <button class=\"like\" id=\"like\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"喜欢\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M12 20.5s-7.6-4.7-7.6-9.8A4.7 4.7 0 0 1 12 7.6a4.7 4.7 0 0 1 7.6 3.1c0 5.1-7.6 9.8-7.6 9.8z\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"title\">未在播放<b>····</b></div>\n    <div class=\"ctrl\">\n      <i><svg class=\"side\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M2 3h2v10H2zM12 3L6 8l6 5z\"/></svg></i>\n      <i class=\"play\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4 2.8l9 5.2-9 5.2z\"/></svg></i>\n      <i><svg class=\"side\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M4 3l6 5-6 5zM12 3h2v10h-2z\"/></svg></i>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"timeline extra\"><span>0:00</span><div class=\"bar\"><i></i></div><span>-:--</span></div>\n    <div class=\"volume extra\"><span>🔈</span><div class=\"vbar\"><i></i></div><span>🔊</span></div>\n    <button class=\"act comment extra\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"评论\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M4 5.5h16v10H9.5L4.5 19.5z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n    <button class=\"act share extra\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"分享\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M12 15.5V4M8 8l4-4 4 4M5 14v5.5h14V14\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var player = document.getElementById('player'),\n      like = document.getElementById('like');\n\n  var expanded = false;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function setExpanded(on){\n    expanded = on;\n    player.classList.toggle('expanded', on);\n    player.setAttribute('aria-expanded', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n  }\n\n  function setLiked(on){\n    like.classList.toggle('liked', on);\n    like.setAttribute('aria-pressed', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n  }\n\n  /* 点卡片展开；收起只认「点卡片外面」——点卡片本身（展开态）不再切换 */\n  player.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n    if(!expanded) setExpanded(true);\n  });\n  document.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n    if(expanded && !player.contains(e.target)) setExpanded(false);\n  });\n\n  like.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    setLiked(!like.classList.contains('liked'));\n  });\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key === 'Escape') setExpanded(false); });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    setExpanded(false);\n    setLiked(false);\n\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n    c.moveTo(player);\n\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.release();\n        setExpanded(true);\n        setTimeout(function(){\n          c.moveTo(like);\n          setTimeout(function(){\n            c.press();\n            setTimeout(function(){\n              c.release();\n              setLiked(true);\n              /* 收起：点卡片外面的空白 */\n              setTimeout(function(){\n                c.el.style.transition = 'none';\n                c.el.style.left = (window.innerWidth / 2) + 'px';\n                c.el.style.top = '28px';\n                setTimeout(function(){\n                  c.press();\n                  setTimeout(function(){\n                    c.release();\n                    setExpanded(false);\n                    if(c.hide) c.hide();\n                  }, 190);\n                }, 300);\n              }, 800);\n            }, 170);\n          }, 460);\n        }, 700);\n      }, 170);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 5400); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
